# Kids Car Racing — configuration. Copy this file to `.env` for local
# development and fill in the values. NEVER commit a real `.env` file,
# and NEVER paste real keys into chat, code, or docs — keys are supplied
# via the secure flow only, or as EAS secrets for builds.
# EXPO_PUBLIC variables are inlined at build time: after changing them,
# restart the dev server (`npx expo start`) or rebuild the app.

# RevenueCat — Google Play public SDK key, from the RevenueCat
# dashboard (Project Settings → API keys). Leave empty and the Parents
# Shop keeps its exact "Not set up yet" behaviour: no prices, no
# purchase, no unlock, no coins/gems granted.
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_API_KEY=

# AdMob — app ID + rewarded video unit ID, from the AdMob console.
# Leave empty and every rewarded button says "Ads are not set up yet"
# and grants nothing. No banner or interstitial ads exist in this app.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ADMOB_APP_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_ADMOB_REWARDED_UNIT_ID=
